Rotating Field Theory \u8594\'3f  }{\rtlch\af9\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af9\loch
The Yang-Mills curvature tensor R\u7491\'3f_\{r\u952\'3f\} in \u167\'a7I is a rotating gauge field in polar coordinates. Tesla's foundational insight \u8212\'97 that rotation in a field requires no mechanical switching, that the field IS the rotation \u8212\'97 is exactly what the kinetic Lagrangian term encodes: neural weight-field dynamics as a self-rotating gauge structure.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052\sb30\sa30\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052{\rtlch\af11\afs20\ab \ltrch\hich\af6\loch\cf22\fs20\b\f6\dbch\af11\loch
Resonant Frequency Matching \u8594\'3f  }{\rtlch\af9\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af9\loch
The Zeta-Fermat Heartbeat in \u167\'a7IV (P(t) = Re[\u950\'3f(s)\u183\'b7\u966\'3f\u8315\'3f\u8319\'3f\u183\'b7e^\{i(\u969\'3f\u7522\'3ft\u7522\'3f+\u969\'3f\u8337\'3ft\u8337\'3f)\}]) is Tesla's wireless transmission principle at cosmological scale. Two oscillators at slightly different frequencies produce a beat. The universe hums because \u969\'3f\u7522\'3f \u8800\'3f \u969\'3f\u8337\'3f. Tesla tried to broadcast power by matching the Earth's resonant frequency. This conjecture proposes the universe does the same.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052\sb30\sa30\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052{\rtlch\af11\afs20\ab \ltrch\hich\af6\loch\cf22\fs20\b\f6\dbch\af11\loch
Radial Field Emanation \u8594\'3f  }{\rtlch\af9\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af9\loch
The Noether current \u8711\'3f\u183\'b7J_\{Noether\} = Pressure(\u923\'3f) in \u167\'a7V \u8212\'97 outward arrows from the horizon in every direction simultaneously \u8212\'97 is Wardenclyffe. Tesla's tower was a standing-wave radiator using the planet as the resonant cavity. The Hairy Horizon is that, with the event horizon as the cavity wall and the cosmological constant as the broadcast pressure.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052\sb30\sa30\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052{\rtlch\af11\afs20\ab \ltrch\hich\af6\loch\cf22\fs20\b\f6\dbch\af11\loch
Visual Reception Mode \u8594\'3f  }{\rtlch\af9\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af9\loch
Tesla ran complete machines in his mind before building them \u8212\'97 checking for wear, finding flaws, verifying operation \u8212\'97 all before a single wire was connected. This conjecture arrived the same way. The geometry was visible before the formalism. The Horizon Invariance visualization was recognized on contact, not constructed from description. That is Tesla's method.}
