Faraday proposed \u8212\'97 without the mathematics to prove it, against the consensus of every credentialed physicist of his era \u8212\'97 that fields are not a convenient fiction for calculating forces between particles. Fields are the fundamental reality. Particles are secondary. The entire Ainulindal\u235\'eb Conjecture is built on this foundation. The gauge field, the information field, the metric field \u8212\'97 all primary. Mass, charge, consciousness \u8212\'97 secondary. Faraday was right.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052\sb30\sa30\loch

