Induction as the Master Principle \u8594\'3f  }{\rtlch\af9\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af9\loch
Faraday's law of induction: a changing field induces a force opposing that change. The Hamiltonian of Consciousness in \u167\'a7III \u8212\'97 V(Focus) = \u8464\'3f\u183\'b7d\u934\'3f/dt\u8337\'3f \u8212\'97 is Faraday's law applied to information. Information Inductance \u8464\'3f resists change in the information phase. Consciousness is the back-EMF of the observer on the field. Faraday described this in iron filings and copper wire. This conjecture describes it in Lagrangian notation. The physics is identical.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052\sb30\sa30\loch

