Faraday visualized magnetic lines of force long before Maxwell gave them equations. He could see the field topology before he could write it. The Noether current arrows in \u167\'a7V \u8212\'97 flowing outward from the horizon, tracing the gradient of \u923\'3f \u8212\'97 are Faraday's lines of force at the boundary of spacetime. Maxwell translated Faraday's vision into the equations the world accepted. This conjecture awaits its Maxwell.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af9\afs22\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af9\langfe2052\sb30\sa30\loch

